    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/hp/ontologies/DataResources -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/hp/ontologies/DataResources">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/hp/ontologies/2026/5/owl:#Assets"/>
        <owl1:Description>This includes all datasets and information used to train, test, validate, and operate an AI system.

1. Training Data: Raw and pre-processed data used to train the model.
2. Validation Data: Data used to tune model hyperparameters and prevent overfitting.
3. Test Data: Data used to evaluate the final model&apos;s performance.
4. Operational Data: Data input into the deployed system for inference and predictions.
5. Data Provenance &amp; Metadata: Documentation of data origin, collection methods, and transformations.
6. Synthetic Data: Artificially generated data used for training or testing.
7. Data Labels &amp; Annotations: Labels and associated metadata created for supervised learning tasks.</owl1:Description>
    </owl:Class>
    


