        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/hp/ontologies/2026/5/owl:#ModelLifecycleRequirements"/>
        <owl1:Description>The system shall support side-by-side comparison of model versions on live traffic (A/B testing).</owl1:Description>
