        <Condition:Inference>If a NonFunctionalRequirements has category &quot;Portability&quot; or &quot;Installability&quot; or &quot;Replaceability&quot; and constrains an InfrastructureResources, then the requirement constrains the infrastructure asset.</Condition:Inference>
