        <RuleID>R‑MAP‑NFR‑ASSET‑002</RuleID>
        <Condition:Inference>If a NonFunctionalRequirements has category &quot;Reliability&quot; or &quot;FaultTolerance&quot; or &quot;Recoverability&quot; and constrains an InfrastructureResources, then the requirement constrains the infrastructure asset.</Condition:Inference>
